 countries.",noRegP2:"If you believe you should not receive this notification, please contact support@bybit.com or Livechat support.","Existing account":"Already have an account","Log in immediately":l,"Create an account":f,banUSIPTitleLogin:"Important Announcement",banUSIPContentLogin:"We have detected that you have logged in and traded on Bybit with an IP address from the United States of America. Please note that Bybit does not allow US citizens and residents to trade on Bybit. Effective 2020/05/20, your US IP address will be restricted to login to your trading account.<br /><br />Should you have any inquiries, you can click on the bottom right corner of our official website to contact our live chat support. We apologise for any inconvenience caused.",regCotBanTitle:"Declaration",regCotBanDesc:"Are you a resident or national of the following restricted countries or regions?",regCotBanListLabel:"List of Restricted Countries",regCotBanBtnYes:"Yes",regCotBanBtnNo:"No",regRestrictTitle:"Sorry! You're in a restricted area where we cannot offer our products or services.",regRestrictDesc:"If you require any further assistance, feel free to contact us at support@bybit.com.",regRestrictBtnOk:"OK",banCotCN:"Mainland China",banCotCU:"Cuba",banCotIR:"Iran",banCotKP:"North Korea",banCotSD:"Sudan",banCotSG:"Singapore",banCotSY:"Syria",banCotUS:"United States of America",noCountryFound:"Invalid Entry",login:l,"Log out":"Log out",emailLogin:w,phoneLogin:"Mobile",loginSubAcc:"Subaccount",loginSubAccLink:"/app/sub-account-login","Dont have a Bybit account yet":"Don't have a Bybit account yet","Forgot Password":"Forgot password","Register Now":k,"Login Real Account":l,"Please enter the verification code from Google Authenticator":"Please enter the verification code from Google Authenticator","Google verification code":"Google verification code","Invalid Google 2FA code entered, please try again":"Invalid Google 2FA code entered, please try again",invalidGoogle2fa:"Please enter veri