atives</span> Exchange with the Best Perpetual Contracts',tail:"We listen, care, and improve to provide the best possible trading experience",buttonEyebrow:"Receive $10 and start trading for free",buttonText:"Create an account within 30 seconds","button.link":Ee},bybitIntro:{title:'Why Choose <h1 class="font" white bold inherit>Bybit</h1>?',titleTail:"Our liquidity ranks second, because we put our clients first","intro.1.title":"State-of-the-Art Matching Engine","intro.1.desc":"Never worry about overloads, with our 100,000 TPS per contract and 10x industry speed","intro.2.title":"Technical Expertise","intro.2.desc":"No server downtimes, with our grey release feature and hot patches released on the go","intro.3.title":"Assets Security","intro.3.desc":"Keep your funds safe, with our Hierarchical Deterministic Cold Wallet System storing all assets, and manual withdrawals processed up to 3 times a day","intro.4.title":"24/7 Service","intro.4.desc":"Receive immediate feedback. Chat live, 24/7, with our professional multilingual Customer Support."},userMap:{title:'<span class="font" bold>100,000 Registered</span> Users and Counting',titleTail:"Currently supporting English, Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, and Japanese"},newsEducation:{title:'<span class="font" bold>News</span> and Education',"news.1.bg":"/images/news-education/1.jpg","news.1.link":"https://help.bybit.com/hc/en-us/articles/360012780693-Consensus-Invest-2018-Bybit-s-Debut-Attracted-Foreign-Investments","news.1.title":"CONSENSUS INVEST 2018","news.1.desc":e,"news.2.link":"https://bitcoinnews.com/pr-global-cryptocurrency-derivatives-exchange-bybit-releases-ethereum-perpetual-contract/","news.2.title":"Global Cryptocurrency Derivatives Exchange Bybit Releases Ethereum Perpetual Contract","news.2.desc":e,"news.3.link":"https://help.bybit.com/hc/en-us/articles/360019413493-Bybit-s-platform-latest-technical-updates-On-going-","news.3.title":"Bybit Weekly Technical Update","news.3.desc":e,"news.4.bg":"/images/news-education/4.jpg","news.4.link":"https://help.bybit.com/hc/en-us/articles/360012865933-Bybit-Definition-Features-Uses","news.4.title":"Bybit: Definition, Features & Uses","news.4.desc":e,"news.5.bg":"/images/news-education/5.jpg","news.5.link":"https://help.bybit.com/hc/en-us/articles/360012567614-Cryptocurrency-Trading-Exit-Strategy-Take-Profit-Stop-Loss-and-Trailing-Stop","news.5.title":"Cryptocurrency Trading, Exit Strategy: Take Profit Stop Loss and Trailing Stop","news.5.desc":e},aboutUs:{title:'About <span class="font" bold>us</span>',"core.title":"CORE VALUE","core.tail":"WE LISTEN, CARE, AND IMPROVE","detail.1.title":"OUR VISION","detail.1.desc":"Bybit aims to revolutionize today's cryptocurrency market by combining the best of cryptocurrencies and traditional finance to bring about the industry's safest, most reliable, fairest, and most user-friendly trading platform with a high liquidity. ","detail.1.desc.2":"Bybit offers 100x leverage perpetual contracts, guarantees no overloads or server downtime, protects users' assets with the industry's leading security features, provides a 24/7 Live customer support and a direct line to our CEO on Twitter.","detail.2.title":"TEAM BACKGROUND","detail.2.desc":"Headquarted in Singapore and registered in BVI, our founding team is made of professionals from the Forex industry, investment banking, and early blockchain adopters. Our technology team includes experts from numerous leading companies such as Morgan Stanley, Tencent, Ping'an Bank, Nuoya Fortune, etc.","detail.2.findMore":"Check out our employees on Linkedin to learn more","detail.2.findMore.link":Ne,"detail.twitter.link":v,"detail.fb.link":"https://www.facebook.com/bybitfintech/?modal=admin_todo_tour","detail.linkedin.link":Ne},loveBybit:{title:'<span class="font" bold>They</span> love <h1 class="font" inherit>Bybit</h1>',users:[{avatar:"/images/avatar/the-wolf.jpg",name:"The Wolf",at:"imnotthewolf",slogan:"The cryptocurrency derivatives market has proven t